      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Dreame___/status/2024225076757897252",
      "text": "🚨During a major fire in Mandaue City, Cebu, Philippines, a woman refused to leave her home without rescuing her dogs. As the blaze intensified, she climbed a ladder, tossed each dog to safety, and then dangled from a railing until firefighters could reach her. She escaped with only minor injuries, and all her dogs survived thanks to her determination and love.\n\nMany people have called her a hero for putting her pets’ safety above her own fear.\n\nIt raises an important question: Would you risk your life to save your pets, or would fear keep you back?",
